{"n":12,"title":"Save the date","blurb":"Дни, месяцы и даты · повторение глав 1–3","steps":[{"stage":"Warm-up","type":"note","title":"Save the date","sub":"","html":"<p>Дни, месяцы, дни рождения — и быстрый обзор всего пройденного.</p><ul class=\"cp-aims\"><li>Называть дни и месяцы</li><li>Называть дату: the third of May</li><li>Повторить юниты 1–3</li></ul>"},{"stage":"Warm-up","type":"pick","title":"Выберите свои выходные.","sub":"Здесь нет неправильного ответа.","options":[{"label":"Saturday"},{"label":"Sunday"},{"label":"Monday"},{"label":"Friday"},{"label":"every day"},{"label":"never"}]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"cards","title":"Слова урока","sub":"Нажми на карточку, чтобы увидеть перевод","words":[{"en":"Monday","ru":"понедельник","kk":"дүйсенбі","def":"I work on Monday.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/fce2716cd639.mp3"},{"en":"Tuesday","ru":"вторник","kk":"сейсенбі","def":"The meeting is on Tuesday.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/69a51a5f1a0c.mp3"},{"en":"Wednesday","ru":"среда","kk":"сәрсенбі","def":"Wednesday is my busy day.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/6ce397a88fbd.mp3"},{"en":"Thursday","ru":"четверг","kk":"бейсенбі","def":"See you on Thursday.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/51f819fcb9b0.mp3"}]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите день.","sub":"","prompt":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/ff4d4933b69f.mp3","options":["Sunday","Saturday","Friday"],"answer":"Friday","html":""},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите день.","sub":"","prompt":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/7c60f4d9dfe2.mp3","options":["Saturday","Sunday","Thursday"],"answer":"Sunday","html":""},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"cards","title":"Слова урока","sub":"Нажми на карточку, чтобы увидеть перевод","words":[{"en":"Friday","ru":"пятница","kk":"жұма","def":"I finish work early on Friday.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/ff4d4933b69f.mp3"},{"en":"Saturday","ru":"суббота","kk":"сенбі","def":"On Saturday I play football.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/56090e949b69.mp3"},{"en":"Sunday","ru":"воскресенье","kk":"жексенбі","def":"Sunday is a family day.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/7c60f4d9dfe2.mp3"},{"en":"weekend","ru":"выходные","kk":"демалыс күндері","def":"Have a good weekend!","img":null,"audio":"/learning/audio/a0/505eabdfb808.mp3"}]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"cards","title":"Слова урока","sub":"Нажми на карточку, чтобы увидеть перевод","words":[{"en":"January","ru":"январь","kk":"қаңтар","def":"New Year's Day is on 1st January.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/34cd359f9d40.mp3"},{"en":"February","ru":"февраль","kk":"ақпан","def":"Valentine's Day is on 14th February.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/bee3cbe6e4ed.mp3"},{"en":"March","ru":"март","kk":"наурыз","def":"Women's Day is on 8th March.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/8689ee28c503.mp3"},{"en":"July","ru":"июль","kk":"шілде","def":"In July we're in Turkey.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/39b3821c86f2.mp3"},{"en":"December","ru":"декабрь","kk":"желтоқсан","def":"December is cold here.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/1aebd3d7ffd7.mp3"}]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"note","title":"Порядковые числа","sub":"","html":"<table class=\"cp-table\"><tr><th>Число</th><th>Порядковое</th><th>В дате</th></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>first</td><td>1st January</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>second</td><td>2nd March</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>third</td><td>3rd May</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>fourth</td><td>4th November</td></tr><tr><td>20</td><td>twentieth</td><td>20th July</td></tr></table><p>В датах — порядковые числа: the <b>third</b> of May, а не «three May».</p><p>Только 1st, 2nd и 3rd особые. С 4 — <b>-th</b>.</p><p>Пишем <b>20th July</b>, говорим «the twentieth of July».</p>"},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите число.","sub":"","prompt":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/22077adedbd2.mp3","options":["first","fourth","fifth"],"answer":"first","html":""},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите число.","sub":"","prompt":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/0abce6f3c0b0.mp3","options":["third","thirteenth","thirtieth"],"answer":"third","html":""},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"gap","title":"Послушайте. Дополните число.","sub":"","before":"the","after":"of the month","answers":["twelfth"],"bank":["twelfth","twentieth","twenty-first"],"src":"/course/a0/audio/5ba8c0a2df28.mp3"},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"phrases","title":"Послушайте два предложения.","sub":"В одном — день, в другом — месяц.","items":[{"text":"I play football on Saturday.","src":null},{"text":"In July we're in Turkey.","src":null}]},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"note","title":"at / on / in","sub":"","html":"<table class=\"cp-table\"><tr><th>Слово</th><th>С чем</th><th>Пример</th></tr><tr><td>at</td><td>clock times, night</td><td>at 7 o'clock · at night</td></tr><tr><td>on</td><td>days and dates</td><td>on Monday · on 3rd May</td></tr><tr><td>in</td><td>months, parts of the day</td><td>in July · in the morning</td></tr></table><p>Дни и даты — всегда <b>on</b>: <b>on</b> Friday, <b>on</b> 14th February.</p><p>Месяцы — <b>in</b>: <b>in</b> July.</p><p>Время по часам — по-прежнему <b>at</b>, как в уроке 11.</p><p class=\"cp-note__fwd\">Дни недели всегда с заглавной буквы.</p>"},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"note","title":"Смотрите и слушайте.","sub":"","html":"","examples":["What's the date today?","It's the third of May.","My birthday is on 3rd May.","I work on Monday and Tuesday.","In July we're in Turkey.","See you on Friday!"]},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Выберите правильное слово.","sub":"","prompt":"The meeting is ___ Tuesday.","options":["in","at","on"],"answer":"on","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Выберите правильное слово.","sub":"","prompt":"My holiday is ___ July.","options":["in","on","at"],"answer":"in","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Выберите правильное слово.","sub":"","prompt":"My birthday is ___ 14th February.","options":["in","on","at"],"answer":"on","why":"Перед датой — on.","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"cols","title":"on или in?","sub":"","columns":["on","in"],"items":[{"text":"20th July","col":0},{"text":"Wednesday","col":0},{"text":"December","col":1},{"text":"Sunday","col":0},{"text":"January","col":1},{"text":"the morning","col":1}]},{"stage":"Practice","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"1st January = the","after":"of January.","answers":["first"],"bank":["once","first","one"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"3rd May = the","after":"of May.","answers":["third"],"bank":["thirty","third","three"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"4th November = the","after":"of November.","answers":["fourth"],"bank":["forty","four","fourth"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"order","title":"Расставьте слова по порядку.","sub":"","words":["is","3rd","My","birthday","on","May."],"answer":"My birthday is on 3rd May.","why":""},{"stage":"Practice","type":"order","title":"Расставьте слова по порядку.","sub":"","words":["is","today?","date","the","What"],"answer":"What is the date today?","why":""},{"stage":"Practice","type":"order","title":"Расставьте слова по порядку.","sub":"","words":["Turkey.","we","in","In","July","are"],"answer":"In July we are in Turkey.","why":""},{"stage":"Practice","type":"mistake","title":"Найдите ошибку.","sub":"Нажмите на неправильное слово.","tokens":["The","meeting","is","in","Monday."],"bad":3,"answer":"The meeting is on Monday.","why":"С днями — on."},{"stage":"Practice","type":"mistake","title":"Найдите ошибку.","sub":"Нажмите на неправильное слово.","tokens":["My","birthday","is","on","three","May."],"bad":4,"answer":"My birthday is on 3rd May.","why":"В датах — порядковые: third."},{"stage":"Practice","type":"mistake","title":"Найдите ошибку.","sub":"Нажмите на неправильное слово.","tokens":["I","work","on","july."],"bad":2,"answer":"I work in July.","why":"Месяцы — с in и с заглавной буквы."},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Повторение: выберите правильное предложение.","sub":"","prompt":"Юнит 1 · вкусы","options":["I don't likes coffee.","I don't like coffee.","I no like coffee."],"answer":"I don't like coffee.","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Повторение: выберите правильное предложение.","sub":"","prompt":"Юнит 1 · to be","options":["She is from Japan.","She are from Japan.","She from Japan."],"answer":"She is from Japan.","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Повторение: выберите правильное предложение.","sub":"","prompt":"Юнит 2 · притяжательные","options":["They son is Fergus.","Their son is Fergus.","Theirs son is Fergus."],"answer":"Their son is Fergus.","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"gap","title":"Повторение: дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"There","after":"two bedrooms in my flat.","answers":["are"],"bank":["is","are","have"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"gap","title":"Повторение: дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"She","after":"got a new laptop.","answers":["has"],"bank":["have","has","is"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"gap","title":"Повторение: дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"He's","after":"engineer.","answers":["an"],"bank":["an","a","the"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"order","title":"Повторение: расставьте слова по порядку.","sub":"","words":["my","These","keys.","are"],"answer":"These are my keys.","why":""},{"stage":"Practice","type":"order","title":"Повторение: расставьте слова по порядку.","sub":"","words":["from?","you","Where","are"],"answer":"Where are you from?","why":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"Когда Женский день?","src":"/course/a0/audio/d19a7a678b9d.mp3","options":["on 8th May","on 8th March","on 18th March"],"answer":"on 8th March","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"Когда Новый год?","src":"/course/a0/audio/cab8548991f4.mp3","options":["on 1st January","on 1st June","on 31st January"],"answer":"on 1st January","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"gap","title":"Послушайте. Дополните дату.","sub":"","before":"Nelson Mandela died on","after":"December 2013.","answers":["5th"],"bank":["5th","15th","25th"],"src":"/course/a0/audio/6a688207182e.mp3"},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Запишите дату.","sub":"","prompt":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/a65258ca3417.mp3","options":["14th November","4th November","4th September"],"answer":"4th November","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Запишите дату.","sub":"","prompt":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/92df1c0b08d1.mp3","options":["12th July 2009","20th July 2009","12th June 2009"],"answer":"12th July 2009","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"gap","title":"Послушайте. Дополните дату.","sub":"","before":"","after":"May","answers":["13th"],"bank":["13th","30th","3rd"],"src":"/course/a0/audio/988b7b445f1d.mp3"},{"stage":"Listening","type":"note","title":"Прочитайте про Бека.","sub":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Bek</p><p>Hi! I'm Bek. My birthday is on the third of May.</p><p>I work from Monday to Friday.</p><p>On Saturday I play football with my brother.</p><p>In July we're in Turkey. It's our holiday month.</p>"},{"stage":"Listening","type":"choice","title":"True или False?","sub":"","prompt":"Bek's birthday is in May.","options":["True","False"],"answer":"True","why":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Bek</p><p>Hi! I'm Bek. My birthday is on the third of May.</p><p>I work from Monday to Friday.</p><p>On Saturday I play football with my brother.</p><p>In July we're in Turkey. It's our holiday month.</p>","src":null},{"stage":"Listening","type":"choice","title":"True или False?","sub":"","prompt":"Bek works on Saturday.","options":["True","False"],"answer":"False","why":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Bek</p><p>Hi! I'm Bek. My birthday is on the third of May.</p><p>I work from Monday to Friday.</p><p>On Saturday I play football with my brother.</p><p>In July we're in Turkey. It's our holiday month.</p>","src":null},{"stage":"Listening","type":"gap","title":"Прочитайте ещё раз. Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"","after":"July they are in Turkey.","answers":["In"],"bank":["At","On","In"],"why":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Bek</p><p>Hi! I'm Bek. My birthday is on the third of May.</p><p>I work from Monday to Friday.</p><p>On Saturday I play football with my brother.</p><p>In July we're in Turkey. It's our holiday month.</p>","src":null},{"stage":"Speaking","type":"write","title":"Напишите свои даты.","sub":"День рождения, выходные и месяц отпуска.","placeholder":"","html":"<ul class=\"cp-frames\"><li>My birthday is on ___ .</li><li>I don't work on ___ .</li><li>In ___ I'm on holiday.</li></ul><div class=\"cp-note__chips\"><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">on</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">in</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">1st</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">3rd</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">14th</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">May</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">July</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">December</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">Saturday</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">Sunday</span></div>","modelHtml":"<ul class=\"cp-checks\"><li>Перед датами и днями — <b>on</b>.</li><li>Перед месяцами — <b>in</b>.</li><li>Дни и месяцы — с заглавной буквы.</li></ul>"},{"stage":"Speaking","type":"record","title":"Произнесите предложения. Запишите и послушайте.","sub":"Сначала послушайте каждое предложение.","items":["What's the date today?","My birthday is on the third of May.","I work on Monday and Tuesday.","In July I'm on holiday.","Have a good weekend!"]},{"stage":"Wrap","type":"checklist","title":"Урок 12 пройден","sub":"Урок 12 из 24 · половина курса","items":["Я могу назвать дни и месяцы.","Я могу назвать дату: the third of May.","Я помню грамматику юнитов 1–3."]}]}
